[26:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for us. And so, sell that outcome. Sell that story. Sell the transformation. Sell the real impact of what you\'re delivering. So, if we go back to the HVAC story, uh, every company I\'ve ever called has had trouble answering their'

